  "about": {
    "title": "About the Roaring Skies set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Roaring Skies is a XY expansion released on 6 May 2015. It has 112 cards: 108 in the main set and 2 secret rares and 2 alternate versions. There are also 87 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 108 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (195 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 199 cards, adding the 2 secret rares and 2 alternate versions).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
    ]
